      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cottonport%2C_Louisiana",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cottonport was incorporated in 1888, officially becoming a town on the scenic Bayou Rouge.",
